      <tr class="is-modified">
        <td><details>
          <summary>
            <code>…/compose/runtime/IsometricNode.kt</code>
            <span class="pl-chip pl-chip--modified">modified</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="pl-card">
            <p><strong>Intent:</strong> G1 — Add alpha propagation in GroupNode.renderTo: early return when alpha==0f; call context.withAlpha(alpha) to build childContext; update leaf nodes to multiply context.accumulatedAlpha into applyAlpha. Update IsometricNode.alpha KDoc to describe both leaf and Group paths.</p>
            <pre class="diff"><span class="diff-add">+ if (alpha == 0f) return</span>
<span class="diff-add">+ val alphaContext = effectiveContext.withAlpha(alpha)</span>
<span class="diff-ctx">  // pass alphaContext (not effectiveContext) to withTransform</span>
<span class="diff-add">+ val effectiveColor = color.withAlpha(context.accumulatedAlpha * alpha)</span></pre>
          </div>
        </details></td>
        <td>modified</td>
        <td>domain</td>
        <td>+30 / -5</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="is-modified">
        <td><details>
          <summary>
            <code>…/compose/runtime/RenderContext.kt</code>
            <span class="pl-chip pl-chip--modified">modified</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="pl-card">
            <p><strong>Intent:</strong> Add <code>private val accumulatedAlpha: Float = 1f</code> to primary constructor. Add <code>fun withAlpha(alpha: Float): RenderContext</code> factory that returns copy with product. Update equals/hashCode. RenderContext remains @Immutable — all new fields are val.</p>
            <pre class="diff"><span class="diff-add">+ private val accumulatedAlpha: Float = 1f</span>
<span class="diff-add">+ fun withAlpha(alpha: Float): RenderContext = RenderContext(</span>
<span class="diff-add">+     …, accumulatedAlpha = (this.accumulatedAlpha * alpha).coerceIn(0f, 1f)</span>
<span class="diff-add">+ )</span>
<span class="diff-add">+ val effectiveAlpha: Float get() = accumulatedAlpha</span></pre>
          </div>
        </details></td>
        <td>modified</td>
        <td>domain</td>
        <td>+12 / -2</td>
      </tr>
