            <span class="pl-chip pl-chip--modified">modified</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="pl-card">
            <p><strong>Intent:</strong> G1 — Add <code>alpha: Float = 1f</code> parameter to <code>Group</code> composable. Wire via <code>set(alpha) { this.alpha = it; markDirty() }</code>. Purely additive — no existing parameters change.</p>
            <pre class="diff"><span class="diff-add">+ alpha: Float = 1f,</span>
<span class="diff-add">+ set(alpha) { this.alpha = it; markDirty() }</span></pre>
