      <tr class="is-modified">
        <td><details>
          <summary>
            <code>…/compose/runtime/AdvancedSceneConfig.kt</code>
            <span class="pl-chip pl-chip--modified">modified</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="pl-card">
            <p><strong>Intent:</strong> G3 — Add KDoc paragraph documenting that callback fields are excluded from equals()/hashCode() and what callers must do instead. E4 secondary constructor already in working tree; commit it.</p>
            <pre class="diff"><span class="diff-add">+ * **Callback re-registration:** The callback parameters (onHitTestReady,</span>
<span class="diff-add">+ *   onFlagsReady, etc.) are excluded from equals() and hashCode(). Replacing</span>
<span class="diff-add">+ *   an AdvancedSceneConfig whose only difference is a callback will NOT trigger</span>
<span class="diff-add">+ *   recomposition. Use rememberUpdatedState for callbacks, or key the config</span>
<span class="diff-add">+ *   on a version counter.</span></pre>
